<metadata><name>Snowlands 1929 Glass Creek</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 8. Up to 10.4 miles round trip (7.4 miles round trip to Glass Creek Meadow). Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/19/1929_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
